# CONTROL (inside the case, nothing to restore): a keybinds file that still has the digit rows does not carry the marker, so the checks above can fail.
WRITE | old/keybinds.pdl | KEY \p pov_mode_1 \p 49 # '1' first person\nKEY \p pov_mode_2 \p 50 # '2' third person\n
EXPECT_LACKS | old/keybinds.pdl | (was 1; D152) | CONTROL: a file left on the digits has no marker
EXPECT_HAS | old/keybinds.pdl | pov_mode_1 \p 49 | CONTROL: the scratch file really holds the old digit row
